{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm Katana Dance</strong> is the adrenaline-fueled lovechild of <strong>Ghostrunner</strong> and <strong>Hi-Fi Rush</strong> \u2014a level-based, beat-driven blood-dance where every slash, sprint, and wall-run snaps on-beat in vibrant, hand-animated arenas. No upgrades, no metagame\u2014just you, your katana, and pure, pulse-pounding tempo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/6444f6fb68394e2af6af73b0d40f80b2.poster.avif?t=1755259790\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/6444f6fb68394e2af6af73b0d40f80b2.webm?t=1755259790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/6444f6fb68394e2af6af73b0d40f80b2.mp4?t=1755259790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn score</strong> by taking out enemies in style.<br><strong>Build momentum</strong> by slaying foes in time with the music, then <i>wall-run</i>, <i>jump</i>, <i>dash</i>, and <i>slide</i> to keep up the pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INFINITE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>Infinite Mode</strong> with a custom playlist of your favorite tracks on <i>loop</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/99ae5f7f15619594d90715b663aee57d.poster.avif?t=1755259790\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/99ae5f7f15619594d90715b663aee57d.webm?t=1755259790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/99ae5f7f15619594d90715b663aee57d.mp4?t=1755259790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>CUSTOM MUSIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import any track via the built-in music editor and play RKD to your own soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/bcc60f00437c1b0ae4f9d96c3bba310f.poster.avif?t=1755259790\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/bcc60f00437c1b0ae4f9d96c3bba310f.webm?t=1755259790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/bcc60f00437c1b0ae4f9d96c3bba310f.mp4?t=1755259790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use level files to create playlists for <i>Infinite Mode</i> or play them individually in regular levels.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667050?t=1755259790","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667050?t=1755259790","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/e8221d666176a389c03b0fd590f877b192dfc7a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755259790","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/e8221d666176a389c03b0fd590f877b192dfc7a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755259790","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm Katana Dance</strong> is the adrenaline-fueled lovechild of <strong>Ghostrunner</strong> and <strong>Hi-Fi Rush</strong> \u2014a level-based, beat-driven blood-dance where every slash, sprint, and wall-run snaps on-beat in vibrant, hand-animated arenas. No upgrades, no metagame\u2014just you, your katana, and pure, pulse-pounding tempo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/6444f6fb68394e2af6af73b0d40f80b2.poster.avif?t=1755259790\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/6444f6fb68394e2af6af73b0d40f80b2.webm?t=1755259790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/6444f6fb68394e2af6af73b0d40f80b2.mp4?t=1755259790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn score</strong> by taking out enemies in style.<br><strong>Build momentum</strong> by slaying foes in time with the music, then <i>wall-run</i>, <i>jump</i>, <i>dash</i>, and <i>slide</i> to keep up the pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INFINITE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>Infinite Mode</strong> with a custom playlist of your favorite tracks on <i>loop</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/99ae5f7f15619594d90715b663aee57d.poster.avif?t=1755259790\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/99ae5f7f15619594d90715b663aee57d.webm?t=1755259790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/99ae5f7f15619594d90715b663aee57d.mp4?t=1755259790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>CUSTOM MUSIC</strong></h